From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gr-linkk <280405187+Gr-linkk@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 21:29:06 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] spi: s3c64xx: stop chunked PIO transfers after a wait error

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Gr-linkk <280405187+Gr-linkk@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/spi/spi-s3c64xx.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/spi/spi-s3c64xx.c b/drivers/spi/spi-s3c64xx.c
index 59ca74c27..34c726801 100644
--- a/drivers/spi/spi-s3c64xx.c
+++ b/drivers/spi/spi-s3c64xx.c
@@ -967,6 +967,7 @@ static int s3c64xx_spi_transfer_one(struct spi_controller *host,
 					dev_err(&spi->dev, "RX residue: %d\n", s.residue);
 				}
 			}
+			break;
 		} else {
 			s3c64xx_flush_fifo(sdd);
 		}
